<div class="eyebrow jp">日本語を学びたいあなたへ</div><div class="eyebrow en">A welcoming place to learn Japanese</div>
<h1 class="jp">ことばが広がる。<br><em>世界が近づく。</em></h1><h1 class="en">Learn Japanese.<br><em>Feel at home.</em></h1>
<p class="lead jp">自分のペースで、日本語を一歩ずつ。会話や毎日の暮らしに役立つ日本語を、あなたの希望に合わせて一緒に学びませんか。</p>
<p class="lead en">Take your next step in Japanese at your own pace. Let's work together on the language you need for everyday life, conversation, and your personal goals.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:kambara.nihongo.ayumi@gmail.com?subject=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E8%AA%9E%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%82%B9%E3%83%B3%E3%81%AE%E7%9B%B8%E8%AB%87"> <span class="jp">レッスンについて相談する</span><span class="en">Ask about lessons</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#about"><span class="jp">会について知る ↓</span><span class="en">Discover our group ↓</span></a></div>
<div class="trustline"><span><b>✓</b><span class="jp">どなたでも参加できます</span><span class="en">Everyone is welcome</span></span><span><b>✓</b><span class="jp">個人レッスン</span><span class="en">Individual lessons</span></span></div>
</div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="日本語の学びを表すイラスト"><div class="sun"></div><div class="paper-card"><span class="vertical jp">一緒に、少しずつ。</span><span class="vertical en">ONE STEP AT A TIME</span><div class="eyebrow jp">こんにちは！</div><div class="eyebrow en">KONNICHIWA!</div><h2 class="jp">日本語で、<br>つながろう。</h2><h2 class="en">Let's connect<br>through language.</h2><p class="jp">あなたの「学びたい」を応援します。</p><p class="en">Your goals. Your pace. Your next step.</p><div class="paper-illustration"><div class="circle"></div><div class="leaf"></div><div class="leaf two"></div><div class="wave"></div></div></div><div class="stamp jp">ようこそ！</div><div class="stamp en">WELCOME!</div><div class="floating"><span class="jp">参加費</span><span class="en">Fee</span><strong>¥2,000</strong><span class="jp">10回分</span><span class="en">10 sessions</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-white" id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">ABOUT US / 私たちについて</div><h2 class="jp">日本語を学ぶ人の、身近なパートナー。</h2><h2 class="en">A friendly partner on your Japanese journey.</h2></div><p class="section-intro jp">「日本語を話したい」「もっと自然に伝えたい」その気持ちを大切に、一人ひとりに合った学びを目指します。</p><p class="section-intro en">Whether you want to start speaking or express yourself more naturally, we value your goals and help you take the next step.</p></div>
<div class="features"><article class="feature"><div class="icon">☘</div><h3 class="jp">あなたに合わせて</h3><h3 class="en">Made for you</h3><p class="jp">学びたい内容や目標を相談しながら進めます。初めての方も、まずは気軽にご相談ください。</p><p class="en">Talk with us about your level, interests, and goals. Beginners are welcome to get in touch.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">💬</div><h3 class="jp">個人レッスン</h3><h3 class="en">Individual lessons</h3><p class="jp">一人ひとりのペースを大切に、会話や日本語学習をサポートします。</p><p class="en">Individual lessons give you space to focus on your own learning and conversation needs.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">🌏</div><h3 class="jp">どなたでも歓迎</h3><h3 class="en">Everyone is welcome</h3><p class="jp">日本語を学びたい方なら、どなたでもお問い合わせいただけます。</p><p class="en">Anyone interested in learning Japanese is welcome to contact the group.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="learning"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">HOW IT WORKS / 参加の流れ</div><h2 class="jp">まずは、気軽なお問い合わせから。</h2><h2 class="en">Getting started is simple.</h2></div><p class="section-intro jp">レッスンの日時や会場はご相談のうえ調整します。まずはメールで、学びたいことを教えてください。</p><p class="section-intro en">Lesson times and location are arranged by consultation. Send us an email to share what you would like to learn.</p></div><div class="steps"><article class="step"><h3 class="jp">メールで相談</h3><h3 class="en">Send an enquiry</h3><p class="jp">日本語のレベル、勉強したいこと、希望する日時などをお知らせください。</p><p class="en">Tell us about your level, learning goals, and preferred times.</p></article><article class="step"><h3 class="jp">内容・日時を相談</h3><h3 class="en">Plan together</h3><p class="jp">ご希望を伺いながら、レッスンの内容・日時・会場を相談します。</p><p class="en">We discuss lesson content, timing, and a suitable location with you.</p></article><article class="step"><h3 class="jp">日本語の学びをスタート</h3><h3 class="en">Begin learning</h3><p class="jp">自分の目標に合わせて、一歩ずつ日本語を学んでいきましょう。</p><p class="en">Start learning step by step, with your goals in mind.</p></article></div></div></section>
